dby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T08:28:20-07:00","id":953193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=953188#post953188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Seconding this, along with a ton of Shards.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seconded. Dno't know how i forgot about them.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T09:12:22-07:00","id":953225,"title":"","content":"We're likely to get PDFs on additional pantheons - Neall's mentioned wanting to do the Loa, the Yazata, and the Gaulish gods as stretch goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T09:52:57-07:00","id":953251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=953225#post953225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're likely to get PDFs on additional pantheons - Neall's mentioned wanting to do the Loa, the Yazata, and the Gaulish gods as stretch goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>We also know for sure that the Atua (Polynesian) Pantheon is scheduled for Demigod, and the Babylonian/Sumerian Pantheon should get in somewhere.<br /> <br /> I have to wonder which Pantheons will wind up in God. Maybe some really obscure ones?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T11:19:54-07:00","id":953306,"title":"","content":"Neall's mentioned several pantheons for future books: Polynesian, Mesopotamian, Canaanite/Phoenician, Inuit, Incan, Mayan, native Australian, and Tagalog (Philippine ethnic group).<br /> <br /> The Anga, the Guarani gods of the southern Amazon, are on his list of stretch goal pantheons.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Oh, and Neall's reasoning on which pantheons are stretch goals is whether they require a more fictional flourish, or different play from a standard Scion game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":51,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","user":"marin","date":". 08-18-2016, 02:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T12:00:40-07:00","id":953338,"title":"","content":"I wonder if an Ainu pantheon might work, either as a new one or an add on to the Kami?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T13:29:04-07:00","id":953389,"title":"","content":"I'm wondering what is the price range that will be for the origins/hero pdf bundle","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/461-kingcarnival","name":"KingCarnival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar461_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T19:24:00-07:00","id":953580,"title":"","content":"I would love for at least some of the pantheons to get their own supplement, diving into lavish detail, if time and resources are available. Culture details, Stories and plot seeds, artifacts and relics, characters and creatures, magic and character options, guidance for using that pantheon alone or in limited coexistence with others*, the whole works. Each pantheon is a rich and unique mythology, and they really deserve some individual attention.<br /> <br /> Seconding the idea of more guidance and plot ideas for what to do at each tier, like starting a small supernatural investigation company at Origins level, or leading a theomachy against Olympus at the God level.<br /> <br /> Hm. How about a supplement that offers aid for different styles of play, like one hero and his band of companions? Or an Indiana Jones style artifact hunt? Different mechanics and advice and all that.<br /> <br /> Really, just &quot;More within Reason&quot; would be lovely. I'm sure I'm missing something I'll think of later, but just one of these ideas seems more than enough.<br /> <br /> *This is in the understanding that different mythologies can have very different tenors, so a story that presumes that the Netjer are the only existing gods would heavily diverge from one that focuses on the Tuatha De Danaan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 08-18-2016, 10:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T22:50:45-07:00","id":953683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=953580#post953580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Seconding the idea of more guidance and plot ideas for what to do at each tier, like starting a small supernatural investigation company at Origins level, or leading a theomachy against Olympus at the God level.</div> </div> </div> </div>It occurs to me we may be basing this on 1e. We don't know if that's what they're already planning for 2e - but it doesn't hurt to let them know we'd like them to do it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T12:35:41-07:00","id":953959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon#post952910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Scion 2e is apparently on track for later this month (RichT said not this week of 8/14, but that doesn't rule out next week) so it's definitely time to start screaming and brace all of our wallets. Everybody panic!<br /> <br /> What stretch goals is everyone hoping for? Will there be previews of the core Origin/Hero books?</div> </div> </div> </div>Lets say it so..........if it holds up what they said that in august the kickstarter will start....there are not many weeks left for itt o start is there? (Although so far I think it always started in the last week....the onyxpath kickstarters I mean)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T21:28:01-07:00","id":956144,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I hope there aren't too many stretch goals. Yeah, it can be cool and all, but they tend to add either bloat or extra projects to manage which just slows down delivery of the entire thing. I really don't want a five month delay because we are waiting for delivery of the art notes for the Yankee Pantheon slash fiction reward tier.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T23:08:15-07:00","id":956177,"title":"","content":"As of the MMN, Neall is working on the Kickstarter video.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T12:58:32-07:00","id":956504,"title":"","content":"Also from the MMN, it appears we may get the Kickstarter in early September as opposed to late August, depends on how long the prep takes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T15:08:53-07:00","id":956579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=956177#post956177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As of the MMN, Neall is working on the Kickstarter video.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please don't do voice overs, they're always so cringeworthy...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T05:21:45-07:00","id":958158,"title":"","content":"So when is this thing kicking off? I'm ready to drop some dollars on it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T08:55:44-07:00","id":958252,"title":"","content":"The best guess we have is within the next two weeks","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/461-kingcarnival","name":"KingCarnival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar461_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T17:02:40-07:00","id":958491,"title":"","content":"Personally I'd like to have a 'Build A Pantheon' Guide, on its own... as it were.For other deities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/205-songtress","name":"Songtress","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T17:34:49-07:00","id":958516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Songtress</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=958491#post958491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally I'd like to have a 'Build A Pantheon' Guide, on its own... as it were.For other deities.</div> </div> </div> </div>Neall has said that this should be relatively easy, and mentioned that he might use the old Atlantean Pantheon as an example of how to do so as a blog post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T19:17:24-07:00","id":958561,"title":"","content":"Cool, frankly, I'd also really just love the having the setting in the Origins/ Hero Book, and see the fiction for the world. Like an Average-day, in a normal life. (Because in a world where the Old Gods are REAL... its neat, and I'd love to see how life, marriage, death, birth amoungst other things are dealt with religiously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/205-songtress","name":"Songtress","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T23:23:58-07:00","id":958620,"title":"","content":"Considering that August is basically finished now, I think it will be happening in September.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think that a cool stretch goal would be something (maybe a shard, maybe a few 'subtle' references, it could be whatever) that allows you to crossover with other Onyx Path/White Wolf games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12300,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12300-crying","user":"Crying","date":".  Making it nicer to look at 08-30-2016, 02:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12300-crying","name":"Crying","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12300_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T03:45:52-07:00","id":959740,"title":"","content":"Do we know if we're going to get a rough draft of the storypath system? The previews / alpha slice seemed interesting but it's not enough for me to warrant a pledge...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2671-legopaidi","name":"legopaidi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T04:41:20-07:00","id":959753,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure it's been said that we will get a rough draft to peruse with the Kickstarter. But that was months (a year, maybe?) ago. So, no telling if such a rough draft will be ready at launch, or if it will come later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/820-gyre","name":"gyre","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T11:19:15-07:00","id":959915,"title":"","content":"How about dice like they did with Pugmire? I'd be down for a new set of Storypath dice like Trinity or Aberrant dice from eons past.<br /> <br /> Dumb forum won't let me attach any photos.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T11:49:29-07:00","id":959933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>karpomatic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=959915#post959915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about dice like they did with Pugmire? I'd be down for a new set of Storypath dice like Trinity or Aberrant dice from eons past.<br /> <br /> Dumb forum won't let me attach any photos.</div> </div> </div> </div>Physical things like dice can tie up Kickstarters for months later than they should. I'd rather this be one long gravy train of books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T13:26:40-07:00","id":959986,"title":"","content":"If they use Backerkit or similar, they could simply have the dice as an after-KS adder.<br /> <br /> That being said, I would rather have the books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1011-phgraves","name":"PHGraves","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1011_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T16:14:24-07:00","id":960069,"title":"","content":"I vote gravy train of books ( 25-40 Dollars gets you (Origins,Hero,Demigod &amp; God as PDFs) and anything after that is GRAVY.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/205-songtress","name":"Songtress","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T16:21:53-07:00","id":960077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Songtress</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=960069#post960069\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I vote gravy train of books ( 25-40 Dollars gets you (Origins,Hero,Demigod &amp; God as PDFs) and anything after that is GRAVY.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demigod and God aren't part of this Kickstarter. It's strictly content for Origins and Hero, like new Pantheons; I know the Persian gods and dead Gaulish ones have both been thrown out as likely stretch goals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T16:45:04-07:00","id":960097,"title":"","content":"Oh that's good to know .. abit sad, but still good. More pantheon depth, I suppose then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/205-songtress","name":"Songtress","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T18:13:14-07:00","id":960144,"title":"","content":"Pantheons, definitely - you can't have too many, if they are fleshed out and given enough detail to make them distinct and playable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T19:37:17-07:00","id":960179,"title":"","content":"Based on the blurb in the MMN this week, it's looking like the Scion Kickstarter is a week or more away.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T23:11:27-07:00","id":960258,"title":"","content":"I did actually think of something else I'd like to see:<br /> <br /> A book purely about Titans. In 1e at least, the Titans were alwas secondary to the Gods and we got significantly less information on them and, well, I think it would be nice to have an entire book dedicated to the Titans.<br /> <br /> Maybe the book would be where they put Titans who aren't tied to any particular Pantheon, or maybe it's where they just throw in extras who they didn't include earlier. I don't know, but a book that focuses on the Titans would be, in my opinion, awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12300-crying","name":"Crying","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12300_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-29T23:14:00-07:00","id":960260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crying</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=960258#post960258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I did actually think of something else I'd like to see:<br /> <br /> A book purely about Titans. In 1e at least, the Titans were alwas secondary to the Gods and we got significantly less information on them and, well, I think it would be nice to have an entire book dedicated to the Titans.<br /> <br /> Maybe the book would be where they put Titans who aren't tied to any particular Pantheon, or maybe it's where they just throw in extras who they didn't include earlier. I don't know, but a book that focuses on the Titans would be, in my opinion, awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm just really excited to see some of the less antagonistic Titans make the cut; none of the Netjer ones seem terribly hostile, whether the Ogdoad (the primordial void-waters of Nu seems like a fascinating character to include) or the more familiar Geb and Nuit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T06:39:19-07:00","id":960401,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=960260#post960260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm just really excited to see some of the less antagonistic Titans make the cut; none of the Netjer ones seem terribly hostile, whether the Ogdoad (the primordial void-waters of Nu seems like a fascinating character to include) or the more familiar Geb and Nuit.</div> </div> </div> </div>We have a different class of deity in 2e - Primordials, who don't manifest except through the Overworld, and then only rarely. They never make Scions*, and while they don't share the lack of empathy of Titans, they're just too conceptually big to fit inside the World.<br /> <br /> *Kitchi-Manitou and the Goddess Danu seem to be weird exceptions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-30T06:44:08-07:00","id":960408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crying</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=958620#post958620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I think that a cool stretch goal would be something (maybe a shard, maybe a few 'subtle' references, it could be whatever) that allows you to crossover with other Onyx Path/White Wolf games.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Man, God of Pugmire</b><br /> Callings: Creator, Hunter, Judge<br /> Purviews: N/A<br /> <br /> Man is just any man. It doesn't even have to be a male, or even conforming to a gender binary. They're just a person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08