://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T14:22:37-07:00","id":987441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=987433#post987433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So hopefully we can get in some more Bestiary chapters over the next week: Nemeans, Yokai, Undead... probably wait on Demigod or God to delve into the true Dragons.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know 'demons' is a little broad, but it would be such a waste to not throw in a write-up for the Egyptian decapitation birds, knife-wielding monsters, and feces-caked crocodile horrors with flames in their bellies somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T09:07:35-07:00","id":987780,"title":"","content":"$255k - Relic section in Companion expanding the corebook coverage.<br /> $260k - New anthology story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T20:03:36-07:00","id":988637,"title":"","content":"We got the relic section!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T14:04:19-07:00","id":990090,"title":"","content":"I'm definitely a little bummed that there's no option for digital backers to add-on the Bestiary. Feels like I'm being punished just because I don't feel like quadrupling my pledge for physical books that I'd never use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T14:12:59-07:00","id":990092,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the hard &quot;no add on for that&quot; stance struck me as odd, it's not like you won't be able to buy it individually in the end anyway.<br /> <br /> Just... weird.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T23:21:37-07:00","id":990293,"title":"","content":"Eh... it's a <i>delay</i>, but it's not a punishment; as CS says, you'll be able to buy it eventually. One of the aims here is encouraging people to back for physical copies, and if you're not that way interested, then yeah, it is going to fall somewhat flat.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-19T23:55:57-07:00","id":990307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990090#post990090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm definitely a little bummed that there's no option for digital backers to add-on the Bestiary. Feels like I'm being punished just because I don't feel like quadrupling my pledge for physical books that I'd never use.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't feel like I'm being <i>punished</i>, considering I initially put down twenty dollars for two books (when I was prepared to pay like 35 for both PDFs), and got a Fiction Anthology, and a whole damn COMPANION (which at this point looks like it'll be almost as big as either of the core books) out of it, so I don't feel like I'm being punished for not immediately getting <i>another</i> book for twenty dollars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T03:33:56-07:00","id":990360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990307#post990307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't feel like I'm being <i>punished</i>, considering I initially put down twenty dollars for two books (when I was prepared to pay like 35 for both PDFs), and got a Fiction Anthology, and a whole damn COMPANION (which at this point looks like it'll be almost as big as either of the core books) out of it, so I don't feel like I'm being punished for not immediately getting <i>another</i> book for twenty dollars.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Amen, brother","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12508-elanconnor","name":"ElanConnor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T08:19:47-07:00","id":990420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990307#post990307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't feel like I'm being <i>punished</i>, considering I initially put down twenty dollars for two books (when I was prepared to pay like 35 for both PDFs), and got a Fiction Anthology, and a whole damn COMPANION (which at this point looks like it'll be almost as big as either of the core books) out of it, so I don't feel like I'm being punished for not immediately getting <i>another</i> book for twenty dollars.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not asking for it for free, I'm wondering why I'm not allowed to pay extra for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T08:44:11-07:00","id":990433,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990420#post990420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not asking for it for free, I'm wondering why I'm not allowed to pay extra for it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's probably a logistics issue. Since they don't know how large the book will grow, they don't know how much to charge for it. They probably don't want to set a price for the add-on, only to have backers later get angry if it turns out to be cheaper for those who waited to buy it from Drive-Thru RPG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T09:14:13-07:00","id":990452,"title":"","content":"Okay, question. I put an extra $28 in my pledge. Does this mean that when the Kickstarter ends I can get the dice? Did I do it right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6783-notanautomaton","name":"notanautomaton","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T09:45:53-07:00","id":990461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>notanautomaton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990452#post990452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, question. I put an extra $28 in my pledge. Does this mean that when the Kickstarter ends I can get the dice? Did I do it right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. Add-Ons are handled by tossing the extra money on top of your pledge and then once the Backerkit comes out, you allocate those funds to Add-Ons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T10:35:11-07:00","id":990483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>White Oak Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990433#post990433\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's probably a logistics issue. Since they don't know how large the book will grow, they don't know how much to charge for it. They probably don't want to set a price for the add-on, only to have backers later get angry if it turns out to be cheaper for those who waited to buy it from Drive-Thru RPG.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's also just a business move. The point of this Kickstarter is to jumpstart the Scion 2e line, so they probably want as many people as possible to up their pledges to physical books, take extra money from those pledges and add them into the cost of traditionally printing the line, so they can purchase more copies than ordered by the Kickstarter and send the remaining ones to retail locations to spread the brand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T10:44:31-07:00","id":990489,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>notanautomaton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=990452#post990452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, question. I put an extra $28 in my pledge. Does this mean that when the Kickstarter ends I can get the dice? Did I do it right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. When the BackerKit goes up, it'll basically have this page listing all the add-ons. Select the dice and you're golden.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T10:50:38-07:00","id":990493,"title":"","content":"New stretch goals:<br /> $300,000 = Bestiary Chapter on elves and fair folk<br /> $305,000 = Two new Anthology stories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3653-thegraysoul","name":"TheGraySoul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-20T12:26:32-07:00","id":990551,"title":"","content":"Just remember, you can only get the dice if you've backed for a physical book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/728-crownedsun","name":"CrownedSun","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar728_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"217"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T10:38:59-07:00","id":1095962,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/952910-kickstarter-soon?p=974941#post974941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I pushed back on having the whole Greek pantheon getting their sacred animals as Beasts subdomains\u2014Hera doesn't really go around using peacock powers in the myth. Athena and Poseidon have mythic reasons for having the Beasts Purview.<br /> <br /> If you want to see a pantheon where everyone has Beasts, you'll have to look to the Netjer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking about the netjer purview. i wanted to ask you,to steal someone's <i>ren </i>to control thhat someone,is it possible at hero level?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}